      "_id": "jKFlnqp7fEIhKPNm",
      "name": "Berserk",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Whenever the troll starts its turn with 60 hit points or fewer, it must make a DC 11 Wisdom save. On a failed save, the troll goes berserk. On each of its turns while berserk, the troll attacks the nearest creature it can see. If no creature is near enough to move and attack, the troll attacks an object, with preference for an object smaller than itself. Once the troll goes berserk, it continues to dos so until its killed or regains all its hit points.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
